    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/2/msa@/~cl_11__para_c__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/2/msa@/~cl_11__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (c), dengan menggantikan perkataan “veterinary officer” dengan perkataan “registered veterinary surgeon”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/2/msa@/~cl_11__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/2/msa@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: “Electronic prescription (2a) When a prescription is prescribed through electronic means, every prescription for any Group B Poison prescribed by a registered medical practitioner, registered dentist or registered veterinary surgeon shall— (a) be created and dated in electronic form; (b) be signed with a digital signature by the prescriber; (c) be sent to a registered pharmacist as an electronic message; and (d) contain information as in paragraphs (2)(b), (c), (d) and (e). (2b) In this section “digital signature” means a signature that is made in accordance with the Digital Signature Act 1997 [Act 562].”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/2/msa@/~cl_11__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/2/msa@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (4) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) Every person selling or supplying any Group B Poison on a prescription shall, at the time of selling or supplying the same, endorse or mark the prescription in a manner so as to permanently attach to the prescription, his name and address and the date on which such poison was sold or supplied.”; dan"
      }
    },
